Update Qt 6.12.0 bundled pcre2 from 10.48 to 10.49.

Modified by Mervin PDF on 2026-11-04.
Preserve Qt build rules, feature configuration and symbol prefixing.
Source https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2/compare/pcre2-10.48...pcre2-10.49
Includes GHSA-r9hj-j2rw-4q3m (growable JIT stack out-of-bounds write).

